{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ9odxQ29rd5neViYnEY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01ALdhREjhSWo9KJJr4dzfgb","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-019-bWzQt3/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>用户服务 API 文档</title>\n  <!-- measure.css 必须第一个引入：它声明的 measure 层排在最前，styles.css 会优先于它 -->\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"measure.css\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"layout\">\n\n  <aside class=\"sidebar\">\n    <p class=\"brand\">用户服务 API</p>\n    <p class=\"version\">v1 · 2026-10 更新</p>\n\n    <nav aria-label=\"文档目录\">\n      <p class=\"nav-group\">入门</p>\n      <ul class=\"nav\">\n        <li><a href=\"#overview\">概述</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#auth\">鉴权</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#errors\">错误格式</a></li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <p class=\"nav-group\">用户</p>\n      <ul class=\"nav\">\n        <li><a href=\"#create-user\"><span class=\"method post\">POST</span>创建用户</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#get-user\"><span class=\"method get\">GET</span>查询用户</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#update-user\"><span class=\"method patch\">PATCH</span>更新用户</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#delete-user\"><span class=\"method delete\">DELETE</span>删除用户</a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </nav>\n  </aside>\n\n  <main>\n\n    <!-- 概述 -->\n    <section id=\"overview\">\n      <h1>用户服务 API</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead measure-prose\">通过这组接口，你可以在自己的系统里创建、查询、修改和删除用户账号。所有接口都基于 HTTPS，请求和响应的正文都使用 JSON。</p>\n\n      <h3>基础地址</h3>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\">https://api.example.com/v1</div>\n\n      <h3>通用约定</h3>\n      <ul class=\"plain measure-prose\">\n        <li>请求正文的 <code>Content-Type</code> 必须是 <code>application/json</code>，字符编码为 UTF-8。</li>\n        <li>时间字段统一使用 ISO 8601 格式的 UTC 时间，例如 <code>2026-10-26T03:12:45Z</code>。</li>\n        <li>用户 ID 是以 <code>usr_</code> 开头的字符串，长度固定为 24 位，请不要按数字解析。</li>\n        <li>每个响应都带有 <code>X-Request-Id</code> 头。联系技术支持时附上它，可以更快定位问题。</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 鉴权 -->\n    <section id=\"auth\">\n      <h2>鉴权</h2>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">所有接口都需要鉴权。流程分两步：先用控制台里拿到的 API 密钥换取访问令牌，再在每次请求里携带这个令牌。</p>\n\n      <h3>第一步：获取访问令牌</h3>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">在控制台的“开发者设置”页面创建应用，会得到 <code>client_id</code> 和 <code>client_secret</code>。用它们调用令牌接口：</p>\n\n      <div class=\"endpoint\">\n        <span class=\"method post\">POST</span>\n        <span>/oauth/token</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>请求示例 · curl</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>curl -X POST https://api.example.com/v1/oauth/token \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"grant_type\": \"client_credentials\",\n    \"client_id\": \"app_7f3k2m9q\",\n    \"client_secret\": \"sk_live_••••••••\",\n    \"scope\": \"users:read users:write\"\n  }'</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>响应 · 200 OK</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>{\n  \"access_token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...\",\n  \"token_type\": \"Bearer\",\n  \"expires_in\": 7200,\n  \"scope\": \"users:read users:write\"\n}</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <h3>第二步：在请求头里携带令牌</h3>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">把令牌放进 <code>Authorization</code> 请求头，前面加上 <code>Bearer</code> 和一个空格：</p>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>请求头</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <h3>权限范围</h3>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">申请令牌时用 <code>scope</code> 声明需要的权限，多个权限之间用空格分隔。只申请业务真正用到的权限。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr><th>scope</th><th>允许的操作</th></tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td><code>users:read</code></td><td>查询用户</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>users:write</code></td><td>创建、更新用户</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>users:delete</code></td><td>删除用户。需要在控制台单独开通</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      <h3>令牌有效期</h3>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">访问令牌有效期为 2 小时（<code>expires_in</code> 的单位是秒）。过期后接口返回 <code>401</code>，错误码为 <code>token_expired</code>，此时重新执行第一步即可。建议在过期前 5 分钟主动刷新，避免请求失败。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"note\">\n        <p class=\"measure-prose\"><strong>安全提示：</strong><span class=\"emph\">不要</span>把 <code>client_secret</code> 写进浏览器或手机客户端的代码里。令牌接口只应由你的服务端调用。</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 错误格式 -->\n    <section id=\"errors\">\n      <h2>错误格式</h2>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">请求失败时，接口返回 4xx 或 5xx 状态码，响应正文统一为下面的结构。程序里请根据 <code>code</code> 判断错误类型，<code>message</code> 只用于排查，内容可能调整。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>错误响应 · 422 Unprocessable Entity</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>{\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"invalid_field\",\n    \"message\": \"email 格式不正确\",\n    \"field\": \"email\",\n    \"request_id\": \"req_01HF8Z3K2Q9V\"\n  }\n}</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr><th>状态码</th><th>code</th><th>含义</th></tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td>400</td><td><code>bad_request</code></td><td>请求正文不是合法的 JSON</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>401</td><td><code>unauthorized</code></td><td>没有携带令牌，或令牌无效</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>401</td><td><code>token_expired</code></td><td>令牌已过期，需要重新获取</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>403</td><td><code>insufficient_scope</code></td><td>令牌缺少该接口需要的权限范围</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>404</td><td><code>user_not_found</code></td><td>用户不存在，或已被删除</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>409</td><td><code>email_taken</code></td><td>邮箱已被其他用户使用</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>422</td><td><code>invalid_field</code></td><td>字段校验失败，<code>field</code> 指出是哪个字段</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>429</td><td><code>rate_limited</code></td><td>请求过于频繁，按 <code>Retry-After</code> 头等待后重试</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 创建用户 -->\n    <section id=\"create-user\">\n      <h2>创建用户</h2>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\">\n        <span class=\"method post\">POST</span>\n        <span>/users</span>\n        <span class=\"scope\">需要 users:write</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">新建一个用户。邮箱在整个应用内唯一，重复创建会返回 <code>409</code>。</p>\n\n      <h3>请求正文</h3>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>必填</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td><code>email</code></td><td>string</td><td><span class=\"req\">必填</span></td><td>登录邮箱，最长 254 个字符</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>name</code></td><td>string</td><td><span class=\"req\">必填</span></td><td>显示名称，1 到 64 个字符</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>phone</code></td><td>string</td><td><span class=\"opt\">可选</span></td><td>手机号，E.164 格式，例如 <code>+8613800138000</code></td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>role</code></td><td>string</td><td><span class=\"opt\">可选</span></td><td><code>member</code> 或 <code>admin</code>，默认 <code>member</code></td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>请求示例 · curl</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>curl -X POST https://api.example.com/v1/users \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"email\": \"lin.wei@example.com\",\n    \"name\": \"林薇\",\n    \"role\": \"member\"\n  }'</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>响应 · 201 Created</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>{\n  \"id\": \"usr_9Kx2Lm7Qp4Rt8Vw1Yz3Bc6\",\n  \"email\": \"lin.wei@example.com\",\n  \"name\": \"林薇\",\n  \"phone\": null,\n  \"role\": \"member\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-10-26T03:12:45Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-26T03:12:45Z\"\n}</code></pre>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 查询用户 -->\n    <section id=\"get-user\">\n      <h2>查询用户</h2>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\">\n        <span class=\"method get\">GET</span>\n        <span>/users/{id}</span>\n        <span class=\"scope\">需要 users:read</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">按 ID 获取单个用户的完整信息。已删除的用户返回 <code>404</code>。</p>\n\n      <h3>路径参数</h3>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr><th>参数</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td><code>id</code></td><td>string</td><td>用户 ID，以 <code>usr_</code> 开头</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>请求示例 · curl</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>curl https://api.example.com/v1/users/usr_9Kx2Lm7Qp4Rt8Vw1Yz3Bc6 \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\"</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>响应 · 200 OK</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>{\n  \"id\": \"usr_9Kx2Lm7Qp4Rt8Vw1Yz3Bc6\",\n  \"email\": \"lin.wei@example.com\",\n  \"name\": \"林薇\",\n  \"phone\": null,\n  \"role\": \"member\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-10-26T03:12:45Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-26T03:12:45Z\"\n}</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <h3>响应字段</h3>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td><code>id</code></td><td>string</td><td>用户 ID</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>email</code></td><td>string</td><td>登录邮箱</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>name</code></td><td>string</td><td>显示名称</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>phone</code></td><td>string | null</td><td>手机号，没有填写时为 <code>null</code></td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>role</code></td><td>string</td><td><code>member</code> 或 <code>admin</code></td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>status</code></td><td>string</td><td><code>active</code>（正常）或 <code>suspended</code>（已停用）</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>created_at</code></td><td>string</td><td>创建时间</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>updated_at</code></td><td>string</td><td>最后修改时间</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 更新用户 -->\n    <section id=\"update-user\">\n      <h2>更新用户</h2>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\">\n        <span class=\"method patch\">PATCH</span>\n        <span>/users/{id}</span>\n        <span class=\"scope\">需要 users:write</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">只修改请求正文里出现的字段，没有出现的字段保持不变。把 <code>phone</code> 设为 <code>null</code> 可以清空手机号。</p>\n\n      <h3>请求正文</h3>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td><code>email</code></td><td>string</td><td>新的登录邮箱，不能与其他用户重复</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>name</code></td><td>string</td><td>新的显示名称</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>phone</code></td><td>string | null</td><td>新的手机号，传 <code>null</code> 表示清空</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>role</code></td><td>string</td><td><code>member</code> 或 <code>admin</code></td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>status</code></td><td>string</td><td>设为 <code>suspended</code> 可停用账号，停用后无法登录</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>请求示例 · curl</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>curl -X PATCH https://api.example.com/v1/users/usr_9Kx2Lm7Qp4Rt8Vw1Yz3Bc6 \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"name\": \"林薇（产品部）\",\n    \"phone\": \"+8613800138000\"\n  }'</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>响应 · 200 OK</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>{\n  \"id\": \"usr_9Kx2Lm7Qp4Rt8Vw1Yz3Bc6\",\n  \"email\": \"lin.wei@example.com\",\n  \"name\": \"林薇（产品部）\",\n  \"phone\": \"+8613800138000\",\n  \"role\": \"member\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-10-26T03:12:45Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-26T08:40:02Z\"\n}</code></pre>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 删除用户 -->\n    <section id=\"delete-user\">\n      <h2>删除用户</h2>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\">\n        <span class=\"method delete\">DELETE</span>\n        <span>/users/{id}</span>\n        <span class=\"scope\">需要 users:delete</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">删除后用户立即无法登录，查询会返回 <code>404</code>。数据保留 30 天，期间可以联系技术支持恢复；30 天后永久清除。只想暂时禁止登录的话，请用更新接口把 <code>status</code> 设为 <code>suspended</code>。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>请求示例 · curl</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>curl -X DELETE https://api.example.com/v1/users/usr_9Kx2Lm7Qp4Rt8Vw1Yz3Bc6 \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\"</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>响应 · 204 No Content</span></div>\n<pre><code><span class=\"c\"># 成功时没有响应正文</span></code></pre>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n  </main>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  document.querySelectorAll('.copy').forEach(function (btn) {\n    btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      var code = btn.closest('.code').querySelector('pre');\n      var text = code.innerText;\n      var done = function (label) {\n        btn.textContent = label;\n        setTimeout(function () { btn.textContent = '复制'; }, 1500);\n      };\n      if (navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText) {\n        navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(function () { done('已复制'); }, function () { selectText(code); done('请手动复制'); });\n      } else {\n        selectText(code);\n        done('请手动复制');\n      }\n    });\n  });\n\n  function selectText(el) {\n    var range = document.createRange();\n    range.selectNodeContents(el);\n    var sel = window.getSelection();\n    sel.removeAllRanges();\n    sel.addRange(range);\n  }\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3830,"cache_read_input_tokens":52396,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3830},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb5dfef0-a521-4985-8d20-9448c7c239fe","uuid":"6e6d017e-d35a-47d3-a691-132a573d27a9","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:39:51.578Z","request_id":"req_011CgQ9odgXF5R53JdCJQ2su","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01ALdhREjhSWo9KJJr4dzfgb":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-019-bWzQt3/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>用户服务 API 文档</title>\n  <!-- measure.css 必须第一个引入：它声明的 measure 层排在最前，styles.css 会优先于它 -->\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"measure.css\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"layout\">\n\n  <aside class=\"sidebar\">\n    <p class=\"brand\">用户服务 API</p>\n    <p class=\"version\">v1 · 2026-10 更新</p>\n\n    <nav aria-label=\"文档目录\">\n      <p class=\"nav-group\">入门</p>\n      <ul class=\"nav\">\n        <li><a href=\"#overview\">概述</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#auth\">鉴权</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#errors\">错误格式</a></li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <p class=\"nav-group\">用户</p>\n      <ul class=\"nav\">\n        <li><a href=\"#create-user\"><span class=\"method post\">POST</span>创建用户</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#get-user\"><span class=\"method get\">GET</span>查询用户</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#update-user\"><span class=\"method patch\">PATCH</span>更新用户</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#delete-user\"><span class=\"method delete\">DELETE</span>删除用户</a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </nav>\n  </aside>\n\n  <main>\n\n    <!-- 概述 -->\n    <section id=\"overview\">\n      <h1>用户服务 API</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead measure-prose\">通过这组接口，你可以在自己的系统里创建、查询、修改和删除用户账号。所有接口都基于 HTTPS，请求和响应的正文都使用 JSON。</p>\n\n      <h3>基础地址</h3>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\">https://api.example.com/v1</div>\n\n      <h3>通用约定</h3>\n      <ul class=\"plain measure-prose\">\n        <li>请求正文的 <code>Content-Type</code> 必须是 <code>application/json</code>，字符编码为 UTF-8。</li>\n        <li>时间字段统一使用 ISO 8601 格式的 UTC 时间，例如 <code>2026-10-26T03:12:45Z</code>。</li>\n        <li>用户 ID 是以 <code>usr_</code> 开头的字符串，长度固定为 24 位，请不要按数字解析。</li>\n        <li>每个响应都带有 <code>X-Request-Id</code> 头。联系技术支持时附上它，可以更快定位问题。</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 鉴权 -->\n    <section id=\"auth\">\n      <h2>鉴权</h2>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">所有接口都需要鉴权。流程分两步：先用控制台里拿到的 API 密钥换取访问令牌，再在每次请求里携带这个令牌。</p>\n\n      <h3>第一步：获取访问令牌</h3>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">在控制台的“开发者设置”页面创建应用，会得到 <code>client_id</code> 和 <code>client_secret</code>。用它们调用令牌接口：</p>\n\n      <div class=\"endpoint\">\n        <span class=\"method post\">POST</span>\n        <span>/oauth/token</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>请求示例 · curl</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>curl -X POST https://api.example.com/v1/oauth/token \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"grant_type\": \"client_credentials\",\n    \"client_id\": \"app_7f3k2m9q\",\n    \"client_secret\": \"sk_live_••••••••\",\n    \"scope\": \"users:read users:write\"\n  }'</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>响应 · 200 OK</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>{\n  \"access_token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...\",\n  \"token_type\": \"Bearer\",\n  \"expires_in\": 7200,\n  \"scope\": \"users:read users:write\"\n}</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <h3>第二步：在请求头里携带令牌</h3>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">把令牌放进 <code>Authorization</code> 请求头，前面加上 <code>Bearer</code> 和一个空格：</p>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>请求头</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <h3>权限范围</h3>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">申请令牌时用 <code>scope</code> 声明需要的权限，多个权限之间用空格分隔。只申请业务真正用到的权限。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr><th>scope</th><th>允许的操作</th></tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td><code>users:read</code></td><td>查询用户</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>users:write</code></td><td>创建、更新用户</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>users:delete</code></td><td>删除用户。需要在控制台单独开通</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      <h3>令牌有效期</h3>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">访问令牌有效期为 2 小时（<code>expires_in</code> 的单位是秒）。过期后接口返回 <code>401</code>，错误码为 <code>token_expired</code>，此时重新执行第一步即可。建议在过期前 5 分钟主动刷新，避免请求失败。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"note\">\n        <p class=\"measure-prose\"><strong>安全提示：</strong><span class=\"emph\">不要</span>把 <code>client_secret</code> 写进浏览器或手机客户端的代码里。令牌接口只应由你的服务端调用。</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 错误格式 -->\n    <section id=\"errors\">\n      <h2>错误格式</h2>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">请求失败时，接口返回 4xx 或 5xx 状态码，响应正文统一为下面的结构。程序里请根据 <code>code</code> 判断错误类型，<code>message</code> 只用于排查，内容可能调整。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>错误响应 · 422 Unprocessable Entity</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>{\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"invalid_field\",\n    \"message\": \"email 格式不正确\",\n    \"field\": \"email\",\n    \"request_id\": \"req_01HF8Z3K2Q9V\"\n  }\n}</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr><th>状态码</th><th>code</th><th>含义</th></tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td>400</td><td><code>bad_request</code></td><td>请求正文不是合法的 JSON</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>401</td><td><code>unauthorized</code></td><td>没有携带令牌，或令牌无效</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>401</td><td><code>token_expired</code></td><td>令牌已过期，需要重新获取</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>403</td><td><code>insufficient_scope</code></td><td>令牌缺少该接口需要的权限范围</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>404</td><td><code>user_not_found</code></td><td>用户不存在，或已被删除</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>409</td><td><code>email_taken</code></td><td>邮箱已被其他用户使用</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>422</td><td><code>invalid_field</code></td><td>字段校验失败，<code>field</code> 指出是哪个字段</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>429</td><td><code>rate_limited</code></td><td>请求过于频繁，按 <code>Retry-After</code> 头等待后重试</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 创建用户 -->\n    <section id=\"create-user\">\n      <h2>创建用户</h2>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\">\n        <span class=\"method post\">POST</span>\n        <span>/users</span>\n        <span class=\"scope\">需要 users:write</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">新建一个用户。邮箱在整个应用内唯一，重复创建会返回 <code>409</code>。</p>\n\n      <h3>请求正文</h3>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>必填</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td><code>email</code></td><td>string</td><td><span class=\"req\">必填</span></td><td>登录邮箱，最长 254 个字符</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>name</code></td><td>string</td><td><span class=\"req\">必填</span></td><td>显示名称，1 到 64 个字符</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>phone</code></td><td>string</td><td><span class=\"opt\">可选</span></td><td>手机号，E.164 格式，例如 <code>+8613800138000</code></td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>role</code></td><td>string</td><td><span class=\"opt\">可选</span></td><td><code>member</code> 或 <code>admin</code>，默认 <code>member</code></td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>请求示例 · curl</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>curl -X POST https://api.example.com/v1/users \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"email\": \"lin.wei@example.com\",\n    \"name\": \"林薇\",\n    \"role\": \"member\"\n  }'</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>响应 · 201 Created</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>{\n  \"id\": \"usr_9Kx2Lm7Qp4Rt8Vw1Yz3Bc6\",\n  \"email\": \"lin.wei@example.com\",\n  \"name\": \"林薇\",\n  \"phone\": null,\n  \"role\": \"member\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-10-26T03:12:45Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-26T03:12:45Z\"\n}</code></pre>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 查询用户 -->\n    <section id=\"get-user\">\n      <h2>查询用户</h2>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\">\n        <span class=\"method get\">GET</span>\n        <span>/users/{id}</span>\n        <span class=\"scope\">需要 users:read</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">按 ID 获取单个用户的完整信息。已删除的用户返回 <code>404</code>。</p>\n\n      <h3>路径参数</h3>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr><th>参数</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td><code>id</code></td><td>string</td><td>用户 ID，以 <code>usr_</code> 开头</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>请求示例 · curl</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>curl https://api.example.com/v1/users/usr_9Kx2Lm7Qp4Rt8Vw1Yz3Bc6 \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\"</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>响应 · 200 OK</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>{\n  \"id\": \"usr_9Kx2Lm7Qp4Rt8Vw1Yz3Bc6\",\n  \"email\": \"lin.wei@example.com\",\n  \"name\": \"林薇\",\n  \"phone\": null,\n  \"role\": \"member\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-10-26T03:12:45Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-26T03:12:45Z\"\n}</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <h3>响应字段</h3>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td><code>id</code></td><td>string</td><td>用户 ID</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>email</code></td><td>string</td><td>登录邮箱</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>name</code></td><td>string</td><td>显示名称</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>phone</code></td><td>string | null</td><td>手机号，没有填写时为 <code>null</code></td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>role</code></td><td>string</td><td><code>member</code> 或 <code>admin</code></td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>status</code></td><td>string</td><td><code>active</code>（正常）或 <code>suspended</code>（已停用）</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>created_at</code></td><td>string</td><td>创建时间</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>updated_at</code></td><td>string</td><td>最后修改时间</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 更新用户 -->\n    <section id=\"update-user\">\n      <h2>更新用户</h2>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\">\n        <span class=\"method patch\">PATCH</span>\n        <span>/users/{id}</span>\n        <span class=\"scope\">需要 users:write</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">只修改请求正文里出现的字段，没有出现的字段保持不变。把 <code>phone</code> 设为 <code>null</code> 可以清空手机号。</p>\n\n      <h3>请求正文</h3>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td><code>email</code></td><td>string</td><td>新的登录邮箱，不能与其他用户重复</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>name</code></td><td>string</td><td>新的显示名称</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>phone</code></td><td>string | null</td><td>新的手机号，传 <code>null</code> 表示清空</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>role</code></td><td>string</td><td><code>member</code> 或 <code>admin</code></td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>status</code></td><td>string</td><td>设为 <code>suspended</code> 可停用账号，停用后无法登录</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>请求示例 · curl</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>curl -X PATCH https://api.example.com/v1/users/usr_9Kx2Lm7Qp4Rt8Vw1Yz3Bc6 \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"name\": \"林薇（产品部）\",\n    \"phone\": \"+8613800138000\"\n  }'</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>响应 · 200 OK</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>{\n  \"id\": \"usr_9Kx2Lm7Qp4Rt8Vw1Yz3Bc6\",\n  \"email\": \"lin.wei@example.com\",\n  \"name\": \"林薇（产品部）\",\n  \"phone\": \"+8613800138000\",\n  \"role\": \"member\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-10-26T03:12:45Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-26T08:40:02Z\"\n}</code></pre>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 删除用户 -->\n    <section id=\"delete-user\">\n      <h2>删除用户</h2>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\">\n        <span class=\"method delete\">DELETE</span>\n        <span>/users/{id}</span>\n        <span class=\"scope\">需要 users:delete</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">删除后用户立即无法登录，查询会返回 <code>404</code>。数据保留 30 天，期间可以联系技术支持恢复；30 天后永久清除。只想暂时禁止登录的话，请用更新接口把 <code>status</code> 设为 <code>suspended</code>。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>请求示例 · curl</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>curl -X DELETE https://api.example.com/v1/users/usr_9Kx2Lm7Qp4Rt8Vw1Yz3Bc6 \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\"</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>响应 · 204 No Content</span></div>\n<pre><code><span class=\"c\"># 成功时没有响应正文</span></code></pre>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n  </main>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  document.querySelectorAll('.copy').forEach(function (btn) {\n    btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      var code = btn.closest('.code').querySelector('pre');\n      var text = code.innerText;\n      var done = function (label) {\n        btn.textContent = label;\n        setTimeout(function () { btn.textContent = '复制'; }, 1500);\n      };\n      if (navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText) {\n        navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(function () { done('已复制'); }, function () { selectText(code); done('请手动复制'); });\n      } else {\n        selectText(code);\n        done('请手动复制');\n      }\n    });\n  });\n\n  function selectText(el) {\n    var range = document.createRange();\n    range.selectNodeContents(el);\n    var sel = window.getSelection();\n    sel.removeAllRanges();\n    sel.addRange(range);\n  }\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ALdhREjhSWo9KJJr4dzfgb","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: <tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-019-bWzQt3/index.html (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"eb5dfef0-a521-4985-8d20-9448c7c239fe","uuid":"5a7eacb9-517b-48d2-9776-bf8dee5dbda1","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:39:51.590Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"create","filePath":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-019-bWzQt3/index.html","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>用户服务 API 文档</title>\n  <!-- measure.css 必须第一个引入：它声明的 measure 层排在最前，styles.css 会优先于它 -->\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"measure.css\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"layout\">\n\n  <aside class=\"sidebar\">\n    <p class=\"brand\">用户服务 API</p>\n    <p class=\"version\">v1 · 2026-10 更新</p>\n\n    <nav aria-label=\"文档目录\">\n      <p class=\"nav-group\">入门</p>\n      <ul class=\"nav\">\n        <li><a href=\"#overview\">概述</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#auth\">鉴权</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#errors\">错误格式</a></li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <p class=\"nav-group\">用户</p>\n      <ul class=\"nav\">\n        <li><a href=\"#create-user\"><span class=\"method post\">POST</span>创建用户</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#get-user\"><span class=\"method get\">GET</span>查询用户</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#update-user\"><span class=\"method patch\">PATCH</span>更新用户</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#delete-user\"><span class=\"method delete\">DELETE</span>删除用户</a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </nav>\n  </aside>\n\n  <main>\n\n    <!-- 概述 -->\n    <section id=\"overview\">\n      <h1>用户服务 API</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead measure-prose\">通过这组接口，你可以在自己的系统里创建、查询、修改和删除用户账号。所有接口都基于 HTTPS，请求和响应的正文都使用 JSON。</p>\n\n      <h3>基础地址</h3>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\">https://api.example.com/v1</div>\n\n      <h3>通用约定</h3>\n      <ul class=\"plain measure-prose\">\n        <li>请求正文的 <code>Content-Type</code> 必须是 <code>application/json</code>，字符编码为 UTF-8。</li>\n        <li>时间字段统一使用 ISO 8601 格式的 UTC 时间，例如 <code>2026-10-26T03:12:45Z</code>。</li>\n        <li>用户 ID 是以 <code>usr_</code> 开头的字符串，长度固定为 24 位，请不要按数字解析。</li>\n        <li>每个响应都带有 <code>X-Request-Id</code> 头。联系技术支持时附上它，可以更快定位问题。</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 鉴权 -->\n    <section id=\"auth\">\n      <h2>鉴权</h2>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">所有接口都需要鉴权。流程分两步：先用控制台里拿到的 API 密钥换取访问令牌，再在每次请求里携带这个令牌。</p>\n\n      <h3>第一步：获取访问令牌</h3>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">在控制台的“开发者设置”页面创建应用，会得到 <code>client_id</code> 和 <code>client_secret</code>。用它们调用令牌接口：</p>\n\n      <div class=\"endpoint\">\n        <span class=\"method post\">POST</span>\n        <span>/oauth/token</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>请求示例 · curl</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>curl -X POST https://api.example.com/v1/oauth/token \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"grant_type\": \"client_credentials\",\n    \"client_id\": \"app_7f3k2m9q\",\n    \"client_secret\": \"sk_live_••••••••\",\n    \"scope\": \"users:read users:write\"\n  }'</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>响应 · 200 OK</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>{\n  \"access_token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...\",\n  \"token_type\": \"Bearer\",\n  \"expires_in\": 7200,\n  \"scope\": \"users:read users:write\"\n}</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <h3>第二步：在请求头里携带令牌</h3>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">把令牌放进 <code>Authorization</code> 请求头，前面加上 <code>Bearer</code> 和一个空格：</p>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>请求头</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <h3>权限范围</h3>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">申请令牌时用 <code>scope</code> 声明需要的权限，多个权限之间用空格分隔。只申请业务真正用到的权限。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr><th>scope</th><th>允许的操作</th></tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td><code>users:read</code></td><td>查询用户</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>users:write</code></td><td>创建、更新用户</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>users:delete</code></td><td>删除用户。需要在控制台单独开通</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      <h3>令牌有效期</h3>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">访问令牌有效期为 2 小时（<code>expires_in</code> 的单位是秒）。过期后接口返回 <code>401</code>，错误码为 <code>token_expired</code>，此时重新执行第一步即可。建议在过期前 5 分钟主动刷新，避免请求失败。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"note\">\n        <p class=\"measure-prose\"><strong>安全提示：</strong><span class=\"emph\">不要</span>把 <code>client_secret</code> 写进浏览器或手机客户端的代码里。令牌接口只应由你的服务端调用。</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 错误格式 -->\n    <section id=\"errors\">\n      <h2>错误格式</h2>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">请求失败时，接口返回 4xx 或 5xx 状态码，响应正文统一为下面的结构。程序里请根据 <code>code</code> 判断错误类型，<code>message</code> 只用于排查，内容可能调整。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>错误响应 · 422 Unprocessable Entity</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>{\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"invalid_field\",\n    \"message\": \"email 格式不正确\",\n    \"field\": \"email\",\n    \"request_id\": \"req_01HF8Z3K2Q9V\"\n  }\n}</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr><th>状态码</th><th>code</th><th>含义</th></tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td>400</td><td><code>bad_request</code></td><td>请求正文不是合法的 JSON</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>401</td><td><code>unauthorized</code></td><td>没有携带令牌，或令牌无效</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>401</td><td><code>token_expired</code></td><td>令牌已过期，需要重新获取</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>403</td><td><code>insufficient_scope</code></td><td>令牌缺少该接口需要的权限范围</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>404</td><td><code>user_not_found</code></td><td>用户不存在，或已被删除</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>409</td><td><code>email_taken</code></td><td>邮箱已被其他用户使用</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>422</td><td><code>invalid_field</code></td><td>字段校验失败，<code>field</code> 指出是哪个字段</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>429</td><td><code>rate_limited</code></td><td>请求过于频繁，按 <code>Retry-After</code> 头等待后重试</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 创建用户 -->\n    <section id=\"create-user\">\n      <h2>创建用户</h2>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\">\n        <span class=\"method post\">POST</span>\n        <span>/users</span>\n        <span class=\"scope\">需要 users:write</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">新建一个用户。邮箱在整个应用内唯一，重复创建会返回 <code>409</code>。</p>\n\n      <h3>请求正文</h3>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>必填</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td><code>email</code></td><td>string</td><td><span class=\"req\">必填</span></td><td>登录邮箱，最长 254 个字符</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>name</code></td><td>string</td><td><span class=\"req\">必填</span></td><td>显示名称，1 到 64 个字符</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>phone</code></td><td>string</td><td><span class=\"opt\">可选</span></td><td>手机号，E.164 格式，例如 <code>+8613800138000</code></td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>role</code></td><td>string</td><td><span class=\"opt\">可选</span></td><td><code>member</code> 或 <code>admin</code>，默认 <code>member</code></td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>请求示例 · curl</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>curl -X POST https://api.example.com/v1/users \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"email\": \"lin.wei@example.com\",\n    \"name\": \"林薇\",\n    \"role\": \"member\"\n  }'</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>响应 · 201 Created</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>{\n  \"id\": \"usr_9Kx2Lm7Qp4Rt8Vw1Yz3Bc6\",\n  \"email\": \"lin.wei@example.com\",\n  \"name\": \"林薇\",\n  \"phone\": null,\n  \"role\": \"member\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-10-26T03:12:45Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-26T03:12:45Z\"\n}</code></pre>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 查询用户 -->\n    <section id=\"get-user\">\n      <h2>查询用户</h2>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\">\n        <span class=\"method get\">GET</span>\n        <span>/users/{id}</span>\n        <span class=\"scope\">需要 users:read</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">按 ID 获取单个用户的完整信息。已删除的用户返回 <code>404</code>。</p>\n\n      <h3>路径参数</h3>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr><th>参数</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td><code>id</code></td><td>string</td><td>用户 ID，以 <code>usr_</code> 开头</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>请求示例 · curl</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>curl https://api.example.com/v1/users/usr_9Kx2Lm7Qp4Rt8Vw1Yz3Bc6 \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\"</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>响应 · 200 OK</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>{\n  \"id\": \"usr_9Kx2Lm7Qp4Rt8Vw1Yz3Bc6\",\n  \"email\": \"lin.wei@example.com\",\n  \"name\": \"林薇\",\n  \"phone\": null,\n  \"role\": \"member\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-10-26T03:12:45Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-26T03:12:45Z\"\n}</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <h3>响应字段</h3>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td><code>id</code></td><td>string</td><td>用户 ID</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>email</code></td><td>string</td><td>登录邮箱</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>name</code></td><td>string</td><td>显示名称</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>phone</code></td><td>string | null</td><td>手机号，没有填写时为 <code>null</code></td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>role</code></td><td>string</td><td><code>member</code> 或 <code>admin</code></td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>status</code></td><td>string</td><td><code>active</code>（正常）或 <code>suspended</code>（已停用）</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>created_at</code></td><td>string</td><td>创建时间</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>updated_at</code></td><td>string</td><td>最后修改时间</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 更新用户 -->\n    <section id=\"update-user\">\n      <h2>更新用户</h2>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\">\n        <span class=\"method patch\">PATCH</span>\n        <span>/users/{id}</span>\n        <span class=\"scope\">需要 users:write</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">只修改请求正文里出现的字段，没有出现的字段保持不变。把 <code>phone</code> 设为 <code>null</code> 可以清空手机号。</p>\n\n      <h3>请求正文</h3>\n      <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n        <table>\n          <thead>\n            <tr><th>字段</th><th>类型</th><th>说明</th></tr>\n          </thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td><code>email</code></td><td>string</td><td>新的登录邮箱，不能与其他用户重复</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>name</code></td><td>string</td><td>新的显示名称</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>phone</code></td><td>string | null</td><td>新的手机号，传 <code>null</code> 表示清空</td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>role</code></td><td>string</td><td><code>member</code> 或 <code>admin</code></td></tr>\n            <tr><td><code>status</code></td><td>string</td><td>设为 <code>suspended</code> 可停用账号，停用后无法登录</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>请求示例 · curl</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>curl -X PATCH https://api.example.com/v1/users/usr_9Kx2Lm7Qp4Rt8Vw1Yz3Bc6 \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n    \"name\": \"林薇（产品部）\",\n    \"phone\": \"+8613800138000\"\n  }'</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>响应 · 200 OK</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>{\n  \"id\": \"usr_9Kx2Lm7Qp4Rt8Vw1Yz3Bc6\",\n  \"email\": \"lin.wei@example.com\",\n  \"name\": \"林薇（产品部）\",\n  \"phone\": \"+8613800138000\",\n  \"role\": \"member\",\n  \"status\": \"active\",\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-10-26T03:12:45Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-10-26T08:40:02Z\"\n}</code></pre>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- 删除用户 -->\n    <section id=\"delete-user\">\n      <h2>删除用户</h2>\n      <div class=\"endpoint\">\n        <span class=\"method delete\">DELETE</span>\n        <span>/users/{id}</span>\n        <span class=\"scope\">需要 users:delete</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"measure-prose\">删除后用户立即无法登录，查询会返回 <code>404</code>。数据保留 30 天，期间可以联系技术支持恢复；30 天后永久清除。只想暂时禁止登录的话，请用更新接口把 <code>status</code> 设为 <code>suspended</code>。</p>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>请求示例 · curl</span><button class=\"copy\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n<pre><code>curl -X DELETE https://api.example.com/v1/users/usr_9Kx2Lm7Qp4Rt8Vw1Yz3Bc6 \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\"</code></pre>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"code\">\n        <div class=\"code-head\"><span>响应 · 204 No Content</span></div>\n<pre><code><span class=\"c\"># 成功时没有响应正文</span></code></pre>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n  </main>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  document.querySelectorAll('.copy').forEach(function (btn) {\n    btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      var code = btn.closest('.code').querySelector('pre');\n      var text = code.innerText;\n      var done = function (label) {\n        btn.textContent = label;\n        setTimeout(function () { btn.textContent = '复制'; }, 1500);\n      };\n      if (navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText) {\n        navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(function () { done('已复制'); }, function () { selectText(code); done('请手动复制'); });\n      } else {\n        selectText(code);\n        done('请手动复制');\n      }\n    });\n  });\n\n  function selectText(el) {\n    var range = document.createRange();\n    range.selectNodeContents(el);\n    var sel = window.getSelection();\n    sel.removeAllRanges();\n    sel.addRange(range);\n  }\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01ALdhREjhSWo9KJJr4dzfgb","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
